'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml

title Active meal-plan lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
skinparam defaultFontSize 16

state "No active plan" as None
state "Plan without generated groceries" as Plan
state "Plan with generated groceries" as Groceries

[*] --> None
None --> Plan : generate-plan [succeeds]
Plan --> Groceries : generate-list [succeeds]
Groceries --> Plan : generate-plan [confirmed and succeeds]
Plan --> None : planning state cleared
Groceries --> None : planning state cleared

note right of None
  Planning state is cleared by a successful
  confirmed reset, or a confirmed dietary
  update whose repair fails.
end note

note bottom of Groceries
  A generated list may be empty.
  Successful dietary repair preserves this
  status and rebuilds the grocery snapshot.
end note

@enduml
'@@author
